pairs={
'summary':('AMD standalone operating EV is USD 85.53bn deployment delay, 347.86bn base and 790.81bn platform scale. Conditional analyst paths before customer equity rebates and partner-asset flows; no probabilities or price targets.','AMD 独立经营企业价值：部署延迟 855.29 亿、基准 3,478.57 亿、平台扩展 7,908.13 亿美元。这些是客户股权回扣及合作资产现金流之前的条件性分析路径，并非概率或目标价。'),
'scope':('June 27, 2026 discount origin; information through October 18, 2026. Dated standalone operating case using later guidance, not a June-information backtest or current combined pro forma. World Labs, Taalas and later financing are not silently included. Current common equity and per-share values remain unavailable.','折现基准日为 2026 年 6 月 27 日；信息截至 2026 年 10 月 18 日。使用后续指引的历史基准日独立经营情景，不是六月信息回测或当前合并备考估值。World Labs、Taalas 及后续融资不被暗中纳入。当前普通股权益和每股价值保持不可用。'),
'growth':('H2 FY2026 is the first editable partial period; H1 actual revenue USD 21,789m is used only to reconstruct full-year sales for growth. H1 cash flows are not valued again. FY2027–2035 are full fiscal years ending on the last Saturday of December. ACT/365.25 discount intervals preserve 52/53-week years.','2026 财年下半年是首个可编辑部分期间；上半年实际收入 21,789 百万美元仅用于重建全年收入增长。上半年现金流不重复估值。2027–2035 为完整财年，十二月最后一个星期六结束。ACT/365.25 折现保留 52／53 周差异。'),
'profitability':('Forecast EBIT expenses R&D, SG&A, recurring acquisition/support costs, future employee grants and incremental lease rent. Acquired intangible amortization is omitted without a second amortization add-back. Fresh grants remain labor cost, never free cash or duplicate future dilution.','预测营业利润扣除研发、销售管理费用、经常性收购支持费用、未来员工授予及新增租赁租金。剔除收购无形资产摊销后不再次加回摊销。新增授予保持劳动成本，不成为免费现金或重复未来稀释。'),
'funding':('Every edit and simulation trial recomputes physical capex less ordinary depreciation, positive full-fiscal sales growth × selected working-capital rate, and the fading economic reinvestment reserve. Entered investment is retained and topped up to the requirement. The USD 421m opening capex-payable settlement stays in H2 only. Falling sales do not automatically release capital. Partner investment cash flows are separate from operating EV.','每次编辑和模拟均重算实物资本支出减普通折旧、正全年收入增量乘选定营运资本比率，以及逐步增加的经济再投资储备。保留输入投资，不足时补足。421 百万美元期初资本支出应付款仅在下半年结算。收入下降不自动释放资本。合作投资现金流与经营企业价值分开。'),
'capital':('R&D remains expensed. Additional economic investment covers replacement, recurring acquisitions and ecosystem capital beyond plant and working capital. It fades in over FY2031–2035 to NOPAT × positive sales growth / selected terminal ROIC, retaining the direct funding floor. Historical book returns are not sustainable incremental economic returns.','研发保持费用化。额外经济投资涵盖设备及营运资本之外的替换、经常性收购和生态资本；于 2031–2035 财年逐步过渡至 NOPAT×正收入增长率／选定终值 ROIC，同时保留直接资金下限。历史账面回报不等于可持续增量经济回报。'),
'wacc':('Nominal USD WACC is 13.5% / 12% / 10.5% for delay / base / scale. These are analyst scenarios, not company-observed rates. Edits and simulations affect the partial period and full-year tail, using each actual fiscal interval.','延迟／基准／扩展名义美元 WACC 为 13.5%／12%／10.5%，属于分析情景而非公司可观测利率。编辑及模拟影响部分期间和完整年度，并采用各自实际财年间隔。'),
 'tax':('Operating cash taxes use the selected annual source rates. No tax credit is invented for operating losses. Debt coupons are financing cash flows, not another deduction from unlevered FCFF.','经营现金税采用选定年度来源税率。经营亏损不产生虚构税收抵免。债务票息属于融资现金流，不再次从无杠杆 FCFF 扣除。'),
 'terminal':('Terminal growth / ROIC: delay 2.5% / 12%, base 3.5% / 20%, scale 4% / 25%. Continuing investment is NOPAT × growth / ROIC; settings below physical and working-capital funding needs are rejected. Revenue growth is not costless.','终值增长率／ROIC：延迟 2.5%／12%，基准 3.5%／20%，扩展 4%／25%。持续投资为 NOPAT×增长率／ROIC；低于实物及营运资本资金需求的设置将被拒绝。收入增长并非没有成本。'),
 'claims':('World Labs: approximately USD 8.2bn all-stock consideration; share count depends on contractual pre-close VWAP and remains unknown. No cash debit plus dilution, and no invented target value. Taalas is a definitive agreement; closing, size and payment mix are unverified. Anthropic up to USD 5bn is reconciled as the existing single exposure by analyst assumption, not an additional USD 5bn.','World Labs：约 82 亿美元全股票对价，股数取决于合同规定的交割前 VWAP，尚未知。不同时扣现金与稀释，也不虚构目标价值。Taalas 为最终协议，交割、规模及支付结构未验证。Anthropic 最高 50 亿美元按分析假设对应现有单笔风险敞口，不再添加另一笔 50 亿美元。'),
 'financing':('August senior notes principal USD 4.75bn and estimated net proceeds USD 4.726bn must be considered together. The USD 875m September maturity is contractual; actual retirement is unverified. These are post-origin events, not current balances. Financing-only illustrations exclude other cash flows and acquired economics.','八月高级债券本金 47.5 亿美元与估计净募集资金 47.26 亿美元必须一并考虑。九月 8.75 亿美元到期来自合同，实际偿还未验证。这些是基准日后事件，不是当前余额。仅融资示例不含其他现金流及收购经济价值。'),
 'claimLimits':('Current equity is gated by current cash and debt, acquisition ownership/economics, legacy employee and ESPP claims, and customer contingent claims. Dated residual pools are after selected ESPP reserves, before remaining legacy employee/customer claims; appendix arithmetic is not common equity. Customer contract paths are not fair values or verified dilution bounds.','当前现金债务、收购所有权及经济价值、旧员工及 ESPP 请求权和客户或有请求权限制当前股权估值。历史剩余资金池已扣选定 ESPP 储备，但未扣剩余旧员工及客户请求权；附录算术不是普通股权益。客户合同路径不是公允价值或已验证稀释边界。'),
 'management':('Ten quarters Q1 2024–Q2 2026 beat the revenue midpoint; five exceeded the upper range. Q4 2025 identified China sales normalization reduces the beat to 2.92%; FY2022 missed initial post-Xilinx guidance by 10.26%. Recent execution does not validate terminal capital returns. Q3 2026 and 2027 directions remain unscored.','2024 年第一季至 2026 年第二季十个季度均超过收入指引中点，五季超过上限。2025 年第四季剔除已识别中国收入后超额为 2.92%；2022 财年较首次赛灵思收购后指引低 10.26%。近期执行不验证终值资本回报。2026 年第三季及 2027 年方向仍未评分。'),
 'history':('FY2016–2025 reported history retains field-level provenance and actual fiscal dates. GAAP operating EBIT retains SBC, R&D and acquired amortization. Xilinx/Pensando, ZT/discontinued operations and 52/53-week periods limit comparability. No organic constant-scope history is invented; missing observations remain unknown.','2016–2025 财年报告历史保留逐字段来源及实际财年日期。GAAP 营业利润保留股份薪酬、研发和收购摊销。赛灵思／Pensando、ZT／终止经营及 52／53 周期间限制可比性。不虚构有机恒定范围历史；缺失观察保持未知。'),
 'uncertainty':('Simulation defaults have zero width and are uncalibrated; Monte Carlo runs manually. Nonzero joint draws recompute funding floors with the same dated standalone scope. No current price comparison, common-equity estimate or scenario probability is produced.','模拟默认零宽度且未经校准，蒙特卡洛手动运行。非零联合抽样按相同历史基准日独立范围重算资金下限。不生成当前价格比较、普通股权益估计或情景概率。')}
